# GitEHR repo .gitignore, kept minimal: only patterns for artefacts this
# repo's tooling actually produces, plus editor/personal local files.

### Rust (the gitehr CLI)

# Cargo build output (tracked: Cargo.lock is deliberately committed so
# release builds are reproducible - see ~/code/house-style/distribution.md)
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Binaries produced by builds (never commit these)
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Docs tooling (Zensical, run via docker compose - see s/docs)
/.cache/
/site/

# GitEHR scaffold strays from testing the CLI at the repo root
/.gitehr/

# Journal editor drafts (legacy journal add wrote tmp/journal/; kept until
# certain no repo instance carries drafts)
/tmp/

# Local environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
*.env

# Personal notes and agent workspace
.private/
.claude/

### GUI (Node/TypeScript - see gui/.gitignore for the frontend's own list)
node_modules/

### Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
